WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.552
This sample creates the employee-department view by joining employees and departments.

00:00:04.552 --> 00:00:10.572
Then it queries only that view to calculate the Sales average salary.

00:00:10.572 --> 00:00:11.922
Compare it with your own approach.

00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:16.497
The important points are the interface grain, exposed columns, and reuse of the published object.

00:00:16.497 --> 00:00:22.277
Connect this idea to a data platform materializing expensive summaries for faster consumption.

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:27.562
Ask what could go wrong if the concept were misunderstood: could rows be duplicated,

00:00:27.562 --> 00:00:34.592
important records disappear, categories be interpreted incorrectly, or a report become difficult to reproduce?

00:00:34.592 --> 00:00:39.892
A strong analyst can explain both the SQL operation and the assumption behind it.

00:00:39.892 --> 00:00:45.120
After the example, summarize the idea in one plain-language sentence before moving on.
